# Nest dirs

Inside `packages/nest/src/<domain>/`:

- `use-cases/` — one class per repo-method-sized data op (Drizzle SQL inline)
- `workflows/` — multi-step orchestration
- `modules/` — focused Nest modules when needed
- `tus/hooks/`, `tus/schemas/` — domain tus handlers + metadata contracts
- `models/` — GraphQL `@ObjectType` (return DB rows; `@ResolveField` for derived; no `@Field` on secrets; **no mappers/**)
- `enums/`, `dto/`, `services/`, `jobs/`, `controllers/`, `pipes/`, `util/`
- Resolver at domain root: `<domain>.resolver.ts` (like `health/`)

Infra top-level: `tus/`, `media/`, `drizzle/`, `errors/`, `validation/`, `pubsub/`.

Do **not** add `db/*.queries.ts` or `presentation/graphql/mappers`.
